00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:39.110
because Corpus Forte asked me to.

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:40.190
So if there's a famous entrepreneur

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:42.180
that you want me to profile next.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:43.650
Leave it in the comments below

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:44.900
