I'd also love to know

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:48.070
which of Eben Pagan's top 10 rules

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:49.070
hit you the hardest.

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:50.340
Leave it in the comments

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:51.520
